{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2022-12-20 08:30:00', 'title': 'ECOLAB AGAIN RECOGNIZED FOR SUSTAINABILITY LEADERSHIP BY CDP AND DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY WORLD AND NORTH AMERICA INDICES', 'text': "ST. PAUL, MINN.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ECOLAB, INC., THE GLOBAL LEADER IN WATER, HYGIENE AND INFECTION PREVENTION SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES, TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN RECOGNIZED FOR CLIMATE AND WATER LEADERSHIP BY CDP AND NAMED TO THE DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY™ INDICES. THE DISTINGUISHED RECOGNITIONS FURTHER DEMONSTRATE ECOLAB'S SUSTAINABILITY LEADERSHIP."}